Z||000000||84Bill||05-22-2001||10:56 AM||||Lisa I am very sorry for that nasty post I put up last night. You did not deserve even the smallest fraction of what was said there. I hope you can find your way to forgiving me and the others for such uncalled for nastiness. I never intended it to be a bashing session. I sincearly regret hurting my Fiero sister in such a cruel way.<BR>Please don't leave the forum because of my stupidity. It is I do not deserve to be a Fiero Member here since I'm not very proud of myself right now.<BR> <BR>Sincearly Sorry<BR>Fiero brother 84Bill<P><BR>I ask that only apologies and bumps be posted here so that Lisa might see it.<BR>Thank you guys<P>||||reg||1
