Z||000002||rogergarrison||05-22-2001||03:53 PM||||I been busy and not in the forum too much last few days. I missed all the Lisa stuff. I did talk to her on the phone and she was pretty upset. She loves her car so much I think shed marry it if it was legal. I know because Im there she does most of the work herself once you show her how to do it. I dont know many girls, if any ,that do anything except wash them. As far as being a spoiled rich XXXXX, I know a lot of those and not one of them would even be seen in a Fiero (at least in my case knowingly in one),much less own one.No one here including myself just shells out a whole wad of money and does there car start to finish in one shot. Im still messing around with mine after 3 years all the time. Im working on a spoiler rite now.  So everyone cut some slack and maybe shell stay. If she was so spoiled and rich, she would be driving a BMW or something. I try not to bash anyone here, although sometimes may look like it. Im just opinionated, takes a lot to change my mind on anything. Anyone can have their own opinions on anything and still keep it civil<P>Roger||||reg||1
